  overlapping circles as the launcher's monochrome layer. Its own file rather than a reuse of
  `ic_launcher_monochrome`, because an adaptive-icon layer carries the launcher's safe-zone
  padding — dropped into a 24dp status-bar slot the mark comes out small and off-centre. The
  system alpha-masks and tints this, so the white fill is convention, not a colour choice.
-->
